# Runtime dependencies as bounded compatible ranges: a lower bound at a known-good
# release and an upper bound below the next breaking major. This file is the
# input; the image and CI install the exact versions pinned in requirements.txt,
# compiled from it (see "Dependency lock" in README.md).

# Fast API Service. These are tightly coupled and pinned to the tested set.
# FastAPI 0.137 added an `_IncludedRouter` route type that prometheus-fastapi-
# instrumentator 8.0.0 cannot introspect (`route.path` -> every request 500s),
# and Starlette is on the 1.x line so a `<1.0` cap silently pulls an incompatible
# Starlette + instrumentator 7.x. Revisit the FastAPI cap once the instrumentator
# handles `_IncludedRouter`.
